@startuml 02-agent-graph
title LangGraph Agent Graph — one turn

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowColor #3A4A6B
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #3A4A6B
  DiamondBackgroundColor #E5EBFB
}

start
:**prepare**
reset per-turn state
recall user facts (Store)
summarize after 16 messages;

repeat
  :**supervisor**
  structured routing decision
  role check + repeat check in code;
  if (next = retrieve?) then (yes)
    :**retrieve**
    knowledge_search via gateway
    hybrid search + rerank;
  elseif (next = research?) then (yes)
    :**research**
    RLM subgraph (see diagram 03);<<#E5EBFB>>
  elseif (next = tools?) then (yes)
    :**tools**
    model sees only role-allowed tools
    MCP lookups · python_analysis
    max 4 tool rounds;
  elseif (next = admin?) then (yes)
    if (reindex documents?) then (yes)
      :**interrupt()**
      wait for human approval;<<#FBEEE0>>
      if (approved?) then (yes)
        :execute via gateway
        (approved_by recorded);
      else (no)
        :record rejection;
      endif
    else (audit log)
      :admin_view_audit_log;
    endif
  else (respond)
  endif
  note right
    Worker exceptions are caught and
    written to state.errors; the supervisor
    re-plans or answers with what it has.
  end note
repeat while (next ≠ respond and hops < 4?) is (yes)
-> no;

repeat
  :**respond**
  stream answer with
  [DOC-ID §Section] citations;
  :**output_guard**
  citations ⊆ this turn's evidence
  brand rules · prompt canary · PII masking;<<#FBEEE0>>
repeat while (failed on first attempt?) is (regenerate with issues)
-> passed, or failed twice;

if (passed?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :replace answer with
  verified sources only;
endif

:**memory_write**
append answer to thread
store user-stated facts
(only after a passing answer);
stop
@enduml
